# Game over in world 2 with no high score, back to the title, a new game: no dropped frames.
# At the title worldLoad(0) loads world 1's art back with the bitplanes off for two pictures; the
# title's copper pass writes the game lists then (copperUpdate), so the next game's start (or the
# attract loop's hall of fame) doesn't rewrite both with the bitplanes on (before the fix: 4 dropped
# frames on the A500, worst 247 %). Skill 5 (short tells), mission 4: hover low at the gunboat, lose
# all 3 choppers.
wait-serial "AGK t0" 1000
key 0x63
key 0x28
wait 5
key 0x11
wait 5
key 0x04
wait-serial "AGK world 2 loaded" 700
key 0x63
key 0x28
wait 5
key 0x05
wait 5
press fire 2
wait 40
press up 20
press left 395
wait-serial "chopper lost" 2500
wait 200
press up 20
press left 395
wait-serial "chopper lost" 2500
wait 200
press up 20
press left 395
wait-serial "chopper lost" 2500
wait-serial "AGK world 1 loaded" 900
wait 100
press fire 2
wait 200
press fire 2
wait 300
screenshot newgame
expect-no-serial "ERR|missing"
expect-no-dropped-frames
